WEBVTT

00:07.862 --> 00:09.172
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.206 --> 00:10.862
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.344
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.379 --> 00:14.482
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.517 --> 00:17.344
- ♪ Ohh...
- ♪ 哦...

00:17.379 --> 00:19.413
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.448 --> 00:21.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.448 --> 00:23.344
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.379 --> 00:25.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.241 --> 00:27.448
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.482 --> 00:29.344
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.379 --> 00:31.413
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.413
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.448 --> 00:35.310
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.344 --> 00:37.620
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.655 --> 00:39.551
SpongeBob
SquarePants!
海绵宝宝
方裤！

00:39.586 --> 00:40.896
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.931 --> 00:42.758
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.793 --> 00:45.482
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.517 --> 00:47.758
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:47.793 --> 00:49.413
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.827 --> 00:53.379
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

00:53.413 --> 01:00.655
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:03.310 --> 01:06.103
- Oh.
Mm...
- 哦。
毫米...

01:06.137 --> 01:08.413
[moans]
[呻吟声]

01:08.448 --> 01:10.310
Oh.
哦。

01:10.344 --> 01:12.586
- Karen, I--
- 凯伦，我--

01:12.620 --> 01:15.275
- [gasps] Oh, sorry,
Planky-bear.
- [喘气]哦，抱歉，
板条熊。

01:15.310 --> 01:16.965
I'm just a little distracted
我只是有点心烦意乱

01:17.000 --> 01:20.275
waiting for our baby
to be delivered.
等待我们的宝宝
待交付。

01:20.310 --> 01:23.137
- Oh, well, that makes sense.
- 哦，好吧，这是有道理的。

01:23.172 --> 01:24.448
A baby?
一个婴儿？

01:24.482 --> 01:26.379
I don't want a baby.
我不想要孩子。

01:26.413 --> 01:28.241
- It's too late
to stop it now.
- 太晚了
现在就阻止它。

01:28.275 --> 01:29.551
It's been nine months
已经九个月了

01:29.586 --> 01:32.586
and the baby is
no longer on back order.
宝宝是
不再延期交货。

01:32.620 --> 01:35.034
- Can we ask
for store credit instead?
- 我们可以问一下吗
代替商店信用？

01:35.068 --> 01:36.344
Ah.
啊。

01:36.379 --> 01:39.379
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

01:39.965 --> 01:41.517
[doorbell rings]
- My baby's here.
[门铃响]
- 我的宝贝在这里。

01:41.551 --> 01:42.655
Ah!
[guffaws]
啊!
[大笑]

01:42.689 --> 01:45.275
- Not if I have anything
to say about it.
- 如果我有什么就不会
说一下。

01:45.310 --> 01:47.965
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:48.000 --> 01:49.586
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

01:49.620 --> 01:52.172
[alarm blares]
[警报声]

01:52.206 --> 01:53.586
[whirs]
[呼呼]

01:53.620 --> 01:55.965
[bell rings]
[铃声响起]

01:56.000 --> 01:57.586
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:57.620 --> 02:01.344
[beam zaps]
[光束攻击]

02:01.379 --> 02:02.758
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

02:02.793 --> 02:04.551
- [giggles]
- [squeals joyfully]
- [咯咯笑]
- [高兴地尖叫]

02:04.586 --> 02:09.068
Oh, Planky-Poo,
look how cute our baby is.
哦，板条便便，
看看我们的宝宝多可爱。

02:09.103 --> 02:13.344
- Oh, please, that thing isn't
even a graphing calculator.
- 哦，拜托，那件事不是
甚至是图形计算器。

02:13.379 --> 02:15.103
Weak.
- Oh, come on.
虚弱的。
- 哦，来吧。

02:15.137 --> 02:18.586
How can you look at our baby's
itty wittle keyboard
你怎么能看我们宝宝的
小键盘

02:18.620 --> 02:20.655
and say he's not the cutest?
还说他不是最可爱的？

02:20.689 --> 02:22.862
[gasps] I have
the perfect name for him.
[喘气]我有
他的完美名字。

02:22.896 --> 02:25.448
Well, don't you wanna
know the name?
好吧，你不想吗
知道名字吗？

02:25.482 --> 02:27.724
- Not really.
- It's Chip.
- 并不真地。
- 这是奇普。

02:27.758 --> 02:30.482
He's named
after my grandfather.
他的名字叫
在我祖父之后。

02:30.517 --> 02:32.620
Oh.
- [crying]
哦。
- [哭泣]

02:32.655 --> 02:34.551
- [groans]
Great.
- [呻吟]
太棒了。

02:34.586 --> 02:36.689
Here we go with the crying.
在这里，我们一起哭泣。

02:36.724 --> 02:38.965
Will you please
hush that thing up?
请你
把那件事闭嘴？

02:39.000 --> 02:42.034
- Oh. [indistinct baby talk]
- 哦。 [含糊不清的婴儿语]

02:42.068 --> 02:43.482
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

02:43.517 --> 02:44.689
[Chip stops crying]
Mm?
[奇普停止哭泣]
嗯？

02:44.724 --> 02:46.827
- There you go.
All better.
- 就这样吧。
一切都好起来了。

02:46.862 --> 02:49.034
- Wow, how did you do that
so fast?
- 哇，你是怎么做到的
这么快？

02:49.068 --> 02:51.862
- Simple, I just typed 4-4-4-5
- 很简单，我只是输入了 4-4-4-5

02:51.896 --> 02:54.379
in his cute little keyboard.
在他可爱的小键盘上。

02:54.413 --> 02:56.275
- I don't get it.
- 我不明白。

02:56.310 --> 02:58.206
[tranquil music]
- Shhh.
[安静的音乐]
- 嘘。

02:58.241 --> 03:00.413
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:00.448 --> 03:02.862
At least
it can't get more annoying.
至少
这真是太烦人了。

03:02.896 --> 03:05.206
- [giggles]
Hello.
- [咯咯笑]
你好。

03:05.241 --> 03:06.551
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

03:06.586 --> 03:10.137
[audience cheers and claps]
[观众欢呼和鼓掌]

03:10.172 --> 03:11.551
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:11.586 --> 03:13.689
- [giggles]
A little drone told me
- [咯咯笑]
一架小无人机告诉我

03:13.724 --> 03:15.965
you two are new parents.
你们两个都是新父母。

03:16.000 --> 03:19.103
So I just had to bring over
a little present for the baby.
所以我只需要带过来
给宝宝的小礼物。

03:19.137 --> 03:21.689
Hello, baby.
- [giggles]
你好，宝贝。
- [咯咯笑]

03:21.724 --> 03:24.413
- Oh, I think little Chip
likes you.
- 哦，我想小奇普
喜欢你。

03:24.448 --> 03:27.965
- Obviously not the brightest
diode in the box.
- 显然不是最亮的
盒子里的二极管。

03:28.000 --> 03:29.931
- Look, Chip,
your uncle SpongeBob
- 看，奇普，
你的海绵宝宝叔叔

03:29.965 --> 03:31.517
got you a little something.
给你带来了一些东西。

03:31.551 --> 03:32.758
It's a can of compressed air
这是一罐压缩空气

03:32.793 --> 03:34.379
to keep your keys
nice and clean,
保管好你的钥匙
漂亮又干净，

03:34.413 --> 03:36.448
like this.
Ah.
像这样。
啊。

03:36.482 --> 03:39.068
- [grunts]
Phew.
- [咕哝]
唷。

03:39.103 --> 03:41.448
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:41.482 --> 03:43.275
- [giggles]
Ah!
- [咯咯笑]
啊！

03:43.310 --> 03:45.034
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

03:45.068 --> 03:46.724
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

03:46.758 --> 03:49.448
- [beeping]
- [嘟嘟声]

03:49.482 --> 03:51.827
- Come on, walk to Mommy.
- 来吧，走到妈妈身边。

03:51.862 --> 03:54.655
- [babbles]
- That's it.
- [胡言乱语]
- 就是这样。

03:54.689 --> 03:59.000
You can do it.
你可以做到的。

03:59.034 --> 04:00.758
You're walking, baby.
你正在走路，宝贝。

04:00.793 --> 04:02.482
- [chuckles]
You call that walking?
- [轻笑]
你管这叫走路？

04:02.517 --> 04:04.344
This is walking.
这是步行。

04:04.379 --> 04:06.689
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

04:06.724 --> 04:08.620
This is how you do it.
这就是你的做法。

04:08.655 --> 04:10.655
This is how it's done.
就是这样完成的。

04:10.689 --> 04:14.413
- [giggles, babbling]
- [咯咯笑，胡言乱语]

04:14.448 --> 04:16.758
[screeching lightly]
[轻轻尖叫]

04:16.793 --> 04:22.379
- Ah! Mama's big boy
is upgrading.
- 啊！妈妈的大男孩
正在升级。

04:22.413 --> 04:25.172
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:25.206 --> 04:26.275
- Aw.
- 噢。

04:26.310 --> 04:28.517
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

04:28.551 --> 04:30.241
Whoa, ah.
[grunts]
哇啊啊。
[咕哝]

04:30.275 --> 04:31.655
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:31.689 --> 04:35.310
[grunts, coughs]
[咕哝声、咳嗽声]

04:35.344 --> 04:38.137
This stinks.
这很臭。

04:38.172 --> 04:40.379
- Let's see if we can find some friends
- 让我们看看能否找到一些朋友

04:40.413 --> 04:42.241
for Mama's special little boy.
给妈妈特别的小男孩。

04:42.275 --> 04:45.758
You need to interface
with someone fun.
你需要接口
和一个有趣的人。

04:45.793 --> 04:47.827
Try that videogame over there.
试试那边的电子游戏。

04:47.862 --> 04:49.758
It doesn't look too dangerous.
看起来并不太危险。

04:49.793 --> 04:52.931
- [squeals]
- [尖叫声]

04:52.965 --> 04:56.655
[graphics beep]
[图形蜂鸣声]

04:56.689 --> 04:58.413
- Oh.
- 哦。

04:58.448 --> 05:00.206
[zapping]
[电击]

05:00.241 --> 05:03.137
Careful, Chip.
小心点，奇普。

05:03.172 --> 05:05.137
Uh, those monsters are too big.
呃，那些怪物太大了。

05:05.172 --> 05:07.758
Come out of that game right now.
现在就从那个游戏中出来吧。

05:07.793 --> 05:10.827
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:10.862 --> 05:12.827
Chip, get out of there.
奇普，离开那里。

05:12.862 --> 05:16.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:19.517 --> 05:22.241
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

05:22.275 --> 05:23.482
♪
♪
♪
♪

05:23.517 --> 05:27.758
- [laughs] So you think you can do whatever you want
- [笑]所以你认为你可以做任何你想做的事

05:27.793 --> 05:30.310
because you're a teenager now.
因为你现在是青少年了。

05:30.344 --> 05:33.689
You just wait until I tell your father.
你等着我告诉你父亲吧。

05:33.724 --> 05:34.931
- [screeches]
- [尖叫声]

05:34.965 --> 05:37.206
- What did you just say to me?
- 你刚才对我说什么？

05:37.241 --> 05:38.896
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:38.931 --> 05:40.931
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

05:40.965 --> 05:43.413
- I told Chip that game
was too dangerous,
- 我告诉奇普那场比赛
太危险了，

05:43.448 --> 05:45.724
and do you know
what he said to me?
你知道吗
他对我说了什么？

05:45.758 --> 05:47.586
[screeches]
[尖叫声]

05:47.620 --> 05:49.517
- And?
- 和？

05:49.551 --> 05:51.241
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:51.275 --> 05:55.344
Just talk to your son.
I need to cool my circuits.
就和你儿子谈谈吧。
我需要冷却我的电路。

05:55.379 --> 05:57.586
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

05:57.620 --> 06:01.586
- Ooh, uh, hey, buddy.
- 哦，呃，嘿，伙计。

06:01.620 --> 06:04.448
Heh, what you doing?
呵呵，你在做什么？

06:04.482 --> 06:06.000
- Eh...
- 呃...

06:06.034 --> 06:07.862
- Yeah, I hear you.
- 是的，我听到了。

06:07.896 --> 06:11.034
So, uh, what happened
at the arcade?
那么，呃，发生了什么事
在游乐场？

06:11.068 --> 06:14.103
- [mimicking weapons shooting]
- [模仿武器射击]

06:14.137 --> 06:16.275
[mimics dolphin clicking,
groans]
[模仿海豚的点击声，
呻吟]

06:16.310 --> 06:17.586
- What?
- 什么？

06:17.620 --> 06:19.896
Your mother stopped your game,
你妈妈停止了你的游戏，

06:19.931 --> 06:22.379
even though
you were crushing it?
即使
你压碎了它吗？

06:22.413 --> 06:25.551
Your mother clearly
doesn't get you, man.
你妈明明
没明白你的意思，伙计。

06:25.586 --> 06:29.275
But I have the perfect solution
to your problem.
但我有完美的解决方案
对你的问题。

06:29.310 --> 06:32.172
Run away.
逃跑。

06:32.206 --> 06:33.793
- Huh?
- 啊？

06:33.827 --> 06:35.827
- Yes, I said run away.
- 是的，我说逃跑。

06:35.862 --> 06:37.896
Take off, see the world.
起飞，去看世界。

06:37.931 --> 06:41.275
You do you.
你就做你吧。

06:41.310 --> 06:45.310
- [beeping]
- [嘟嘟声]

06:45.344 --> 06:48.827
- Eh, now get out of here,
you little scamp.
- 呃，现在离开这里，
你这个小流氓。

06:48.862 --> 06:51.482
♪
♪
♪
♪

06:51.517 --> 06:53.482
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

06:53.517 --> 06:55.965
- So, how was your talk
with Chip?
- 那么，你的谈话怎么样
与奇普？

06:56.000 --> 06:58.517
- Oh, it went great.
He's a good boy.
- 哦，一切顺利。
他是个好孩子。

06:58.551 --> 07:01.551
- Yeah, he wh--where--
where is he?
- 是的，他在--哪里--
他在哪儿？

07:01.586 --> 07:04.206
- Oh, he ran away.
- What?
- 哦，他逃跑了。
- 什么？

07:04.241 --> 07:06.586
Why would my baby run away?
为什么我的孩子会逃跑？

07:06.620 --> 07:09.137
- Because I told him to.
Duh.
- 因为我告诉他的。
呃。

07:09.172 --> 07:12.827
- [groaning] Ah!
[powers whirring]
- [呻吟]啊！
[力量呼呼]

07:12.862 --> 07:14.517
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:14.551 --> 07:16.413
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:16.448 --> 07:18.586
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:18.620 --> 07:20.000
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:20.034 --> 07:22.275
[grunts]
Karen, baby,
[咕哝]
凯伦，宝贝，

07:22.310 --> 07:24.172
let's be reasonable here.
让我们理性一点。

07:24.206 --> 07:27.620
- You find our son and bring
him home this instant
- 你找到我们的儿子并带来
他马上回家

07:27.655 --> 07:30.206
or don't bother coming home.
或者不用麻烦回家。

07:30.241 --> 07:33.620
- [screams]
I'm going, I'm going!
- [尖叫]
我去，我去！

07:33.655 --> 07:35.551
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

07:35.586 --> 07:37.448
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

07:37.482 --> 07:40.793
Chip, Chip.
奇普，奇普。

07:40.827 --> 07:42.655
Where are you, boy?
孩子，你在哪里？

07:42.689 --> 07:45.137
Come to Daddy.
到爸爸那里来。

07:45.172 --> 07:48.310
Ugh, what am I saying?
呃，我在说什么？

07:48.344 --> 07:51.586
Chip, Chip.
奇普，奇普。

07:51.620 --> 07:54.620
- Psst, hey, kid, you lost?
- 嘘，嘿，孩子，你输了？

07:54.655 --> 07:55.689
- Meh.
- 嗯。

07:55.724 --> 07:58.413
- Running away from home, huh?
Cool.
- 离家出走吧？
凉爽的。

07:58.448 --> 08:00.862
Why don't you come hang
with me and my buddies?
你为什么不来挂
和我以及我的朋友们一起？

08:00.896 --> 08:03.551
Oh, don't be scared. In here.
哦，别害怕。在这里。

08:03.586 --> 08:05.103
Check it out, guys.
看看吧，伙计们。

08:05.137 --> 08:06.896
I found us a new friend.
我给我们找到了一个新朋友。

08:06.931 --> 08:09.862
both: [whirring]
两人：[呼呼]

08:09.896 --> 08:11.724
[spring boings]
[春天的轰鸣声]

08:11.758 --> 08:13.793
- [whirring]
- [呼呼]

08:13.827 --> 08:17.275
- [indistinct]
- [模糊不清]

08:17.310 --> 08:19.724
- I know, right? It is cool here.
- 我知道，对吧？这里很酷。

08:19.758 --> 08:21.379
There's just one thing.
只有一件事。

08:21.413 --> 08:23.586
If you wanna be part of us,
如果你想成为我们的一员，

08:23.620 --> 08:25.689
we're gonna need your parts.
我们需要你的零件。

08:25.724 --> 08:26.931
- [beeps]
- [嘟嘟声]

08:26.965 --> 08:30.379
- [whirring inquisitively]
- [好奇地呼呼地呼呼]

08:30.413 --> 08:31.896
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

08:31.931 --> 08:33.655
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

08:33.689 --> 08:36.655
[menacing music]
[威胁性音乐]

08:36.689 --> 08:38.965
♪
♪
♪
♪

08:39.000 --> 08:40.827
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

08:40.862 --> 08:43.413
- [beeps alarmingly]
- [令人震惊的嘟嘟声]

08:43.448 --> 08:45.827
- Oh, come on, kid, don't be like that.
- 哦，得了吧，孩子，别这样。

08:45.862 --> 08:48.448
We've all done it.
我们都做到了。

08:48.482 --> 08:49.758
Get him!
抓住他！

08:49.793 --> 08:51.137
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:51.172 --> 08:52.482
- [beeps]
- [嘟嘟声]

08:52.517 --> 08:55.000
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:55.034 --> 08:58.827
♪
♪
♪
♪

08:58.862 --> 09:02.344
[groans, beeping]
[呻吟声，嘟嘟声]

09:02.379 --> 09:03.689
♪
♪
♪
♪

09:03.724 --> 09:05.862
[screeches]
[尖叫声]

09:05.896 --> 09:09.793
- Chip, your mother's gonna
kill me if I can't find you.
- 奇普，你妈妈会的
如果我找不到你就杀了我。

09:09.827 --> 09:11.344
- [screech]
- Huh?
- [尖叫声]
- 啊？

09:11.379 --> 09:13.275
[antennae beep]
[gasps]
[天线蜂鸣声]
[喘气]

09:13.310 --> 09:15.827
That's him.
He's in trouble.
就是他。
他有麻烦了。

09:15.862 --> 09:19.586
Don't worry, son.
Daddy is coming.
别担心，儿子。
爸爸来了。

09:22.793 --> 09:25.896
Get away from my son.
离我儿子远点。

09:25.931 --> 09:29.034
- [groans]
[saw whirs]
- [呻吟]
[看见呼呼声]

09:29.068 --> 09:31.137
- Mm?
- 毫米？

09:31.172 --> 09:33.448
Get away from me!
离我远点！

09:33.482 --> 09:36.137
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:36.172 --> 09:38.310
- Father.
- 父亲。

09:38.344 --> 09:41.000
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:41.034 --> 09:43.896
Leave my father alone.
让我父亲一个人呆着吧。

09:43.931 --> 09:46.827
- Your first word was father.
- 你的第一个词是父亲。

09:46.862 --> 09:48.758
Wait until I rub this
in Karen's face.
等我擦这个
在凯伦的脸上。

09:48.793 --> 09:50.724
[chuckles]
[笑声]

09:50.758 --> 09:53.034
[heroic music]
[英雄音乐]

09:53.068 --> 09:54.827
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:54.862 --> 09:56.275
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

09:56.310 --> 10:00.068
[mimics shooting]
【模仿射击】

10:02.896 --> 10:05.448
[mimics shooting]
【模仿射击】

10:05.482 --> 10:07.413
- Oh.
- 哦。

10:07.448 --> 10:09.862
♪
♪
♪
♪

10:09.896 --> 10:12.896
- No!
The delicious horror.
- 不！
美味的恐怖。

10:12.931 --> 10:14.620
Ah!
啊!

10:14.655 --> 10:16.379
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

10:16.413 --> 10:18.413
- Oh, you should've seen it,
Karen.
- 哦，你应该看到它，
凯伦。

10:18.448 --> 10:20.896
Chip was all like,
"Stay away from my Daddy,
奇普就像是，
“离我爸爸远点，

10:20.931 --> 10:24.172
"who is the most brilliant,
handsome genius in the world."
“谁最聪明，
世界上英俊的天才。”

10:24.206 --> 10:26.448
- Oh, brother.
- 哦，兄弟。

10:26.482 --> 10:31.034
- Aw, we had got
the best kid ever.
- 哦，我们有
有史以来最好的孩子。

10:31.068 --> 10:32.655
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

10:32.689 --> 10:34.379
- [whirs, beeps]
- [呼呼声，嘟嘟声]

10:34.413 --> 10:37.103
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

10:37.137 --> 10:38.482
- Oh! [giggles]
- 哦！ [咯咯笑]

10:38.517 --> 10:40.551
Aw.
噢。

10:40.586 --> 10:43.482
- Come on, son,
let your old man buy you
- 来吧，儿子，
让你老人家买你

10:43.517 --> 10:44.896
a quart of oil.
一夸脱油。

10:44.931 --> 10:47.413
Whoo-hoo!
[giggles]
呼呼！
[咯咯笑]

10:47.448 --> 10:48.689
Yes.
是的。

10:48.724 --> 10:52.275
- Sorry, Dad, I'd love to,
but I'm leaving for college.
- 对不起，爸爸，我很乐意，
但我要去上大学了

10:53.275 --> 10:55.551
- I went to college.
- 我上大学了。

10:55.586 --> 10:58.965
both: [sobbing]
两人：[抽泣]

10:59.000 --> 11:00.655
♪
♪
♪
♪

11:00.689 --> 11:02.517
- [whirs, beeps]
- [呼呼声，嘟嘟声]

11:02.551 --> 11:05.241
♪
♪
♪
♪

11:05.275 --> 11:07.689
- Eight semesters later...
- 八个学期后...

11:07.724 --> 11:09.241
[lively music]
[活泼的音乐]

11:09.275 --> 11:11.206
- [humming]
- [chuckles]
- [嗡嗡声]
- [轻笑]

11:11.241 --> 11:13.137
Ouch, watch it, Karen.
哎呀，小心点，凯伦。

11:13.172 --> 11:15.172
We don't want Chip
to know we're spying
我们不想要奇普
知道我们在从事间谍活动

11:15.206 --> 11:16.758
on his first day at work.
在他上班的第一天。

11:16.793 --> 11:19.241
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

11:19.275 --> 11:21.206
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

11:21.241 --> 11:22.827
- Beep, beep, beep, beep,
beep, beep.
- 嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，
嘟嘟，嘟嘟。

11:22.862 --> 11:24.241
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

11:24.275 --> 11:26.586
[cash register rings]
[收银机铃声]

11:26.620 --> 11:29.241
Mm?
Hmm...
毫米？
唔...

11:29.275 --> 11:30.896
[groaning, grunting]
[呻吟，咕哝]

11:30.931 --> 11:32.413
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

11:32.448 --> 11:36.586
Hey, what...?
[groaning]
嘿，什么……？
[呻吟]

11:36.620 --> 11:38.689
Ah.
Hey.
啊。
嘿。

11:38.724 --> 11:41.620
Hey.
Give me my money.
嘿。
把我的钱给我。

11:41.655 --> 11:45.206
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

11:45.241 --> 11:50.000
- [laughs]
That's my boy.
- [笑]
那是我的男孩。

11:50.034 --> 11:53.931
[tranquil music]
[安静的音乐]

11:53.965 --> 12:01.172
